## [:< ##

# name  = jobsite.cmd.sync-soon
# descr = arm the debounced sync push [ the ui's nudge ]

## the web's reverse entries [ a delete in the ui ] ride back on the reply ##
## to jobsite's NEXT push -- without a nudge that was the 300 s timer.     ##
## push_soon coalesces, so a burst of nudges is still one push             ##
<[jobsite.sync.push_soon]>;

return { 'mode' => qw| true |, 'data' => 'sync push armed' };

